msgid "On Tuesday June 9th 05:00 EST / 11:00 CEST / 14:30 IST we will do Quarkus Insights #6: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xcYP-h9uSqs[GraalVM and Mandrel] with https://github.com/adinn[Andrew Dinn]."
