#, fuzzy
msgid "Andrew Dinn is founder of Byteman and contributor to OpenJDK. He and team recently contributed debug support to GraalVM and also key figure in the https://developers.redhat.com/blog/2020/06/05/mandrel-a-community-distribution-of-graalvm-for-the-red-hat-build-of-quarkus/[recently announced Mandrel effort]."
msgstr "Andrew Dinn是Byteman的创始人和OpenJDK的贡献者。他和他的团队最近为GraalVM提供了调试支持，也是 link:https://developers.redhat.com/blog/2020/06/05/mandrel-a-community-distribution-of-graalvm-for-the-red-hat-build-of-quarkus/[最近宣布的Mandrel工作] 的关键人物。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "He will come and talk on his work in OpenJDK and GraalVM and how Quarkus and Mandrel relates to all this."
msgstr "他将在会上介绍他在 OpenJDK 和 GraalVM 方面的工作，以及 Quarkus 和 Mandrel 与这一切的关系。"

